SUMMARY:[MSP SCHEDULING] Course/skill planning forms P4 return deadline
DESCRIPTION:2025 instance stated verbatim in the spring mail: Deadline for P4\, December 15\, 2025\, 5 pm\, which was a Monday. CORRECTED from an inferred Fri 11 Dec: we pulled it forward believing the Christmas break starts 14 Dec\, but the Calendarium marks that week as no education and the closure is 21 Dec to 1 Jan\, so the reasoning never applied. Clean projection is Mon 14 Dec 2026 17:00. Confirmed from fse-scheduling sent items (analysis 24 Aug 2026) | For: course coordinators
END:VEVENT
